Platform Overview

What is it? Box AI is an intelligent assistant built into the box platform that uses advanced AI to help you summarize, understand, and extract insights from your files while keeping your data seecure. It integrates generative AI directly into Box's content management system, allowing you to work smarter with documents stored in the cloud.
What does it do? Box AI functions as an intelligent content management enhancement that integrates advanced AI models directly into your secure cloud storage to streamline how you interact with busines files. By leveraging this tool, you can perform Natural Language queries across individual or multiple documents to find specific details, such as contract clauses or financial figures, without manually scanning through large volumes of text.
Who would use it? Box AI serves a wide range of professional roles within medium to large organizations by automating document-heavy tasks and surfacing insights from vast, unstructured datasets. These Box AI tools are specifically designed to enhance the productivity of team members who interact with content-driven workflows daily, helping them move faster while maintaining robust security and compliance standards. Professional roles such as Legal professionals, Finance Specialists, Sales Personnel, Marketing Teams and HR Adimistrators.
What business problem does it solve? Box AI solves the critical business problem of extracting hidden value from vast amounts of unstructured enterprise content — documents, contracts, invoices, and presentations that contain essential data but remain difficult and time-consuming to access at scale. Organizations struggle with manual, repetitive work around document processing, research, and analysis that slows decision-making and wastes high-value employee time on tasks machines can handle better. Real World use case - Box used its own AI platform to restructure its sales workflow, demonstrating measurable productivity gains that translate directly to revenue impact. Traditionally, Sales Reps would spend a significant amount of time researching prospects, building outreach messaging, and preparing for key meetings — high-effort, repetitive work that delayed deal progression.
What integrations exist? Box AI integrates with major enterprise platforms and developer tools so you can access Box content and AI capabilities directly within the systems your team already uses — without having to switch between multiple applications. This keeps AI-powered insights within familiar workflows and eliminates context-switching. Box AI stores all your customer agreements, contracts, and proposals while using Microsoft 365 on a daily basis. 
